# Allowlisting gitignore template for GO projects prevents us
# from adding various unwanted local files, such as generated
# files, developer configurations or IDE-specific files etc.
#
# Recommended: Go.AllowList.gitignore

# Ignore everything
*

# But not these files...
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/.github/workflows/*

!*.go
!go.sum
!go.mod

!README.md
!LICENSE.md

!doc/*

# !Makefile

# ...even if they are in subdirectories
!*/
!/cmd/
!/cmd/display-test-kms/
!/cmd/display-test-kms/assets/
!/cmd/display-test-kms/assets/beatglow-gray4.png
!/cmd/display-test-kms/assets/BEATGLOW-LOGO-LICENSE
!/internal/
!/internal/buffer/
!/internal/buffer/xrgb_arm64.s
